  "system": {
    "identifier": "futton-boil-release-skilled-mist",
    "description": "<p>You expel a corrosive cloud of mist from your mouth that begins to melt anything it touches, that lingers as a cloud of acidic mist. Creatures, objects and structures in range of this jutsu when cast, or that begin their turns in the affected area must make a Dexterity saving throw.</p>\n<p>Critical Success: Affected creature takes half of 4d6 acid damage.</p>\n<p>Success: Affected creatures takes half of 4d6 acid damage and suffer a -1 penalty to their AC until the beginning of their next turn.</p>\n<p>Failure: Affected creatures take 4d6 acid damage and become Corroded..</p>\n<p>Critical Failure: Same as failure and they also gain a rank of Deteriorate.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d6. If this jutsu is cast at B-Rank or higher, increase the size of the affected area by +20 feet. If this jutsu is cast at S-Rank, increase the size of the affected area by +20 feet.</p>",
